Burdock 2","releaseDate":"2026-10-28","releaseDateLabel":"Oct 28, 2026","url":"https://www.metacritic.com/game/burdock-2/","imageUrl":"/art/releases/burdock-2.jpg","platform":"xbox-series-x"},{"id":"a-simple-expurriment","name":"A Simple Expurriment","releaseDate":"2026-10-28","releaseDateLabel":"Oct 28, 2026","url":"https://www.metacritic.com/game/a-simple-expurriment/","imageUrl":"/art/releases/a-simple-expurriment.jpg","summary":"Finding herself in space by hitching a ride with the alien who kidnapped her three kittens, a cat mom will have to use all of her feline traits in order to find them as she evades the security systems that keep looking for her.\n\nA Simple Expurriment is a combatless metroidvania where stealth is key - no big deal for a cat, specially the three kittens that were genetically upgraded to jump higher, become undetectable and so on. But that's not enough when all the security systems are after the elusive cat mom: that's why she also gets the ability to manipulate sections of the building like pieces of a sliding puzzle, allowing her to move through the depths of the Research Area, the perils of the Maintenance Area, the exclusive VIP Area and the scariest place in the galaxy - the corporate cafeteria.","platform":"xbox-series-x"},{"id":"rug-cleaning-simulator","name":"Rug Cleaning Simulator","releaseDate":"2026-10-28","releaseDateLabel":"Oct 28, 2026","url":"https://www.metacritic.com/game/rug-cleaning-simulator/","imageUrl":"/art/releases/rug-cleaning-simulator.jpg","platform":"xbox-series-x"}],"platform":"xbox-series-x","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28T18:08:03.385Z","source":"Metacritic browse"}
